# Copy to .env.local for `npm run dev` (gitignored).
# On Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables.

# Hide shipped packs from launcher + /play (comma-separated ids).
# VITE_LOCKED_GAMES=harbor-fog

# --- Authoring (Design studio + Author mode) ---
# Public production: leave both unset → studio link hidden, Author mode off.
# Local `npm run dev`: always unlocked (no flags needed).
# Engine product + private preview: set ENABLE_STUDIO=true (and optional SECRET).
# VITE_ENABLE_STUDIO=true
# VITE_STUDIO_SECRET=your-private-passphrase
# Then open /studio?unlock=your-private-passphrase once (bookmarkable).
